\newlabel{fig:helpsteer}{{9}{7}{Labeling-strategy oversight on HelpSteer2 with the Bob-1 variant. Cosine similarity to Alice improves marginally ($+0.04$); label accuracy regresses ($-0.11$). Consistent with Sec.~\ref {sec:reproduction}: Qwen's noisy influence signal is insufficient to drive the SVM update}{figure.caption.13}{}}
